      <h1>Hi, I’m <span class="text-accent">Prajwal S Hangaragi</span></h1>
      <p>Computer Science (AIML) Student | Cybersecurity Enthusiast</p>
      <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 2rem;">
        I build secure, clean, and efficient software systems with a focus on AI, Web Development, and Automation.
